name: Amber Acorn — joker flip
author: corpus
description: >-
  Amber Acorn flips and shuffles all Joker cards. Ante 8 finisher: avoid position-dependent
  jokers or disable with Luchador/Chicot.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: AmberAcorn
    antes: [8]
should:
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: JokerStencil
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 20
